{"4814120": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "ANANTA", "steam_appid": 4814120, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to ANANTA, an Urban Open World RPG with no rules. Step into the shoes of a diverse cast of characters and forge connections as you build a team all your own.<br>Join forces against the threats lurking in the shadows, or live it up and take in the nightlife under the neon glow. The choice is yours.<br><br>In ANANTA, a whole new world awaits you. Ready to take the plunge?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Become an Influencer and Save the World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're a stranger in a strange land, but that's alright.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The moment you set foot in Nova City,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >you start making a name for yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's time to build your reputation, and save the world while you're at it.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4814120/extras/6e776915c8616eed1f2a4a4d9d4317ae.avif?t=1787884647\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4814120/extras_big/6e776915c8616eed1f2a4a4d9d4317ae.avif?t=1787884647 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Two Cities, Two Adventures</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't forget to head back home once in a while.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One plane ticket and you're back to your old stomping grounds of Chongxiao.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But even a place you know like the back of your hand</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >is bound to have a hidden secret or two.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4814120/extras/4b41b9679e67cc64c25bfb582dbaa703.avif?t=1787884647\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4814120/extras_big/4b41b9679e67cc64c25bfb582dbaa703.avif?t=1787884647 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Exhilarating Martial Arts Battles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the second you raise your fist,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the street becomes your stage,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and each strike deserves to go viral.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4814120/extras/85e08f35883aaee66c5815b8990f77f7.avif?t=1787884647\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4814120/extras_big/85e08f35883aaee66c5815b8990f77f7.avif?t=1787884647 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Experience the Thrill of 24/7 City Life</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boredom? Never heard of it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drama that would make soap operas blush one day, 3AM street racing the next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two days are the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every hour has something new on offer, and it can all be streamed anytime.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4814120/extras/56bf478a8ec989b44109ed5c7f87e917.avif?t=1787884647\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4814120/extras_big/56bf478a8ec989b44109ed5c7f87e917.avif?t=1787884647 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Discover Different Walks of Life</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NCCA officer, genius hacker, or gang leader?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inhabit all manner of different characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience this world from top to bottom and everywhere in-between.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who knows, you may befriend some oddballs along the way.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4814120/extras/185cd7b583e29d2478ece2d980a5eeae.avif?t=1787884647\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4814120/extras_big/185cd7b583e29d2478ece2d980a5eeae.avif?t=1787884647 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unlimited Exploration</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn in any direction and set your destination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rev the car engine, hop on a bike, sail the ocean blue,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >or take to the skies, swinging freely between buildings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you can see it, you can go there. So, where to next?<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4814120/extras/1282b79bb410d5fe04610a17b9071ce5.avif?t=1787884647\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4814120/extras_big/1282b79bb410d5fe04610a17b9071ce5.avif?t=1787884647 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to ANANTA, an Urban Open World RPG with no rules. Step into the shoes of a diverse cast of characters and forge connections as you build a team all your own.<br>Join forces against the threats lurking in the shadows, or live it up and take in the nightlife under the neon glow. The choice is yours.<br><br>In ANANTA, a whole new world awaits you. Ready to take the plunge?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Become an Influencer and Save the World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're a stranger in a strange land, but that's alright.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The moment you set foot in Nova City,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >you start making a name for yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's time to build your reputation, and save the world while you're at it.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4814120/extras/6e776915c8616eed1f2a4a4d9d4317ae.avif?t=1787884647\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4814120/extras_big/6e776915c8616eed1f2a4a4d9d4317ae.avif?t=1787884647 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Two Cities, Two Adventures</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't forget to head back home once in a while.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One plane ticket and you're back to your old stomping grounds of Chongxiao.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But even a place you know like the back of your hand</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >is bound to have a hidden secret or two.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4814120/extras/4b41b9679e67cc64c25bfb582dbaa703.avif?t=1787884647\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4814120/extras_big/4b41b9679e67cc64c25bfb582dbaa703.avif?t=1787884647 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Exhilarating Martial Arts Battles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the second you raise your fist,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the street becomes your stage,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and each strike deserves to go viral.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4814120/extras/85e08f35883aaee66c5815b8990f77f7.avif?t=1787884647\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4814120/extras_big/85e08f35883aaee66c5815b8990f77f7.avif?t=1787884647 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Experience the Thrill of 24/7 City Life</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boredom? Never heard of it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drama that would make soap operas blush one day, 3AM street racing the next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two days are the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every hour has something new on offer, and it can all be streamed anytime.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4814120/extras/56bf478a8ec989b44109ed5c7f87e917.avif?t=1787884647\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4814120/extras_big/56bf478a8ec989b44109ed5c7f87e917.avif?t=1787884647 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Discover Different Walks of Life</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NCCA officer, genius hacker, or gang leader?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inhabit all manner of different characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience this world from top to bottom and everywhere in-between.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who knows, you may befriend some oddballs along the way.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4814120/extras/185cd7b583e29d2478ece2d980a5eeae.avif?t=1787884647\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4814120/extras_big/185cd7b583e29d2478ece2d980a5eeae.avif?t=1787884647 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unlimited Exploration</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn in any direction and set your destination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rev the car engine, hop on a bike, sail the ocean blue,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >or take to the skies, swinging freely between buildings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you can see it, you can go there. So, where to next?<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4814120/extras/1282b79bb410d5fe04610a17b9071ce5.avif?t=1787884647\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4814120/extras_big/1282b79bb410d5fe04610a17b9071ce5.avif?t=1787884647 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Welcome to ANANTA, an Urban Open World RPG. Play as a variety of characters and explore everything from bustling business districts and hidden alleyways, to quiet tea towns and buzzing old streets. Rub shoulders with a wide-ranging cast of intriguing characters as you assemble a team all your own.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Russian, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Polish, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Traditional Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Vietnamese, Arabic, Korean<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Portugal, Thai<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4814120/3bd40cfd93dfe6e7a21d9f825fa3b82ee1c57105/header.jpg?t=1787884647", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4814120/700d5ea448d403ac2b7aa8fc330433bf0623b002/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787884647", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4814120/700d5ea448d403ac2b7aa8fc330433bf0623b002/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787884647", "website": "https://www.anantagame.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 64-bit or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> TBD</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 64-bit or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> TBD</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Naked Rain Studio"], "publishers": ["NetEase Games"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, 